# CLAUDE.md

@AGENTS.md

Claude Code reads this file. The rules for every harness are in `AGENTS.md`,
imported above; this file adds only what is specific to Claude Code.

- Register the hub once per machine with `.unified-agent/bin/ua-register-claude`.
  It registers at user scope. Do not add a hub entry to a project `.mcp.json`:
  project scope takes precedence over user scope and would replace the
  authenticated hub connection.
- Skills for this project are in `.claude/skills/`.
